    "content": "Busy day at the bug factory.\n\n@callebtc has done incredible work operationalizing this quickly moving space. We developers engaging in peer review of known issues and providing guidance on how to further interrogate codebases for increased performance.\n\nI am not reachable via dms at this point. Way too many scammers pretending to be media and even sometimes fake victims trying to get me to click links. Please use twitter to find best resources or look at my pinned post for more information.\n\nFor anything related to @AnchorWatch please get a hold of @BeccaAmilee @_joerodgers @Curran2140 @mitch_kochman \n\nThank you for @opencode for providing the open source infrastructure that has allowed us to rapidly scale. It is doing incredible work making the bitcoin ecosystem more safe.\n\nPeople who know how to get a hold of me can get a hold of me.\n\nAnd since its been a very serious week, when I asked if anyone needed anythig from me, and @callebtc told me I should giggle more, so I thought of this prophetic meme from @coinjoined.\n\nIt felt good to laugh again.",
